Output docs/space.gif

Set FontSize 22
Set Width 700
Set Height 360
Set Padding 15
Set Framerate 20

# Space adds five grains a press, so leaning on it turns the trickle into a stream.
Hide
Type "COLORTERM=truecolor ./target/release/sunayama"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show
Space@60ms 45
Sleep 800ms
Hide
Ctrl+C
